L440: **Study Title:** Lessening Organ Dysfunction with Vitamin C:
L441: LOVIT Trial
L442: **Study Number:** MP-31-2019-2945
L443: **Funding Agency:** Lotte and John Hecht Memorial Foundation
L444: **Principal Investigator:** Dr. François Lamontagne, Intensivist
