L450: **FOR INFORMATION**
L451: **Monday through Friday, from 8 am and 4 pm, you can reach:**
L452: Dr. François Lamontagne, Intensivist Tel: 819-346-1110 ext. 74974
L453: Élaine Carbonneau, Research Nurse Tel: 819-346-1110 ext. 16208
