L749: # **LOVIT AUTHORSHIP AND SUB-STUDY GUIDELINES**
L750: **Version:** 1.0
L751: **Date:** 10-Oct-2018
L752: The LOVIT Authorship and Sub-Study Guidelines are the confidential intellectual
L753: property of the LOVIT Principal Investigators and LOVIT Steering Committee and
L754: cannot be used in any form without the expressed permission of the Principal
L755: Investigators.
