L942: |Item|Strongly<br>Disagree|Disagree|Neutral|Agree|Strongly<br>Agree|Comments|
L943: |---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
L944: |Analysis will<br>have a positive<br>impact on the<br>LOVIT trial|||||||
