L1005: Within each participating clinical site, the following individuals will be listed:
L1006: 10-Oct-2018                    Page **10** of **11** Version 1.0
L1007: LOVIT Authorship and Sub-Study Guidelines Confidential
L1008:   - Site Principal Investigator
L1009:   - Site Sub-Investigators
L1010:   - Study Coordinators
L1011: The order of clinical sites listed in the contributor appendix will be based upon
L1012: geographic region. Within each geographical region, the order of the clinical sites will be
L1013: based on participant enrollment, in the order of highest enrollment to the lowest
L1014: enrollment.
L1015: We will credit investigators for their contribution while they were at a LOVIT site if they
L1016: relocate to a hospital that is not participating in LOVIT. If an investigator relocates to
L1017: another LOVIT site or starts a new LOVIT site, we will acknowledge them for their
L1018: contributions at both sites.
L1019: Finally, we will include clinical sites who are initiated and did not enroll participants in
L1020: the contributor appendix. These clinical sites will be listed under a sub-heading of
L1021: initiated and did not enroll.
L1022: The Coordinating Centre Project Manager(s) will be responsible preparing and
L1023: maintaining the contributor appendix. To do so, they will contact each site to confirm the
L1024: individuals who should be listed. The Project Managers will circulate the contributor list
L1025: to each individual clinical site to ensure its accuracy. It is the site’s responsibility to
L1026: ensure that all participating members at their site are listed and that spelling and
L1027: credentials are correct.
